{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無印良品人氣爆燈嘅「睡眠噴霧」推出便攜版！除了方便隨身攜帶，日本更特別推出秋季限定新香！全新系列包括令人放鬆嘅秋冬茶香「伯爵茶」（佛手柑＋紅茶＋草本），以及極具日本秋日氣息嘅「秋日限定」（檸檬＋佛手柑＋金木犀）。</p><p>當然亦唔少得 3 款經典皇牌香氣：主打安神助眠嘅「睡眠」（佛手柑、甜橙、薰衣草）、舒緩身心嘅「放鬆」（檸檬、血橙、杜松果），以及提神醒腦嘅「清新」（檸檬、萊姆、尤加利）。以後帶去旅行都好方便！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179052483954328407_17155619776ab93da8052ce.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179052484142472042_10804991606ab93da9c6369.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179052484357835095_20594617006ab93dabd9949.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179052484512027101_1756910676ab93dad80fa7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179052484665920653_17969179946ab93daf1b104.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179052484852766919_12767619706ab93db10645f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-27T16:18:29.653646+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":274,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}